stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\nstock_change_only_buy: 在庫変更は購入成功時のみ。\nlet out := transition s action amount; out.stock ≠ s.stock → action = 1 ∧ 150 ≤ s.balance ∧ 0 < s.stock\n\nrefund_preserved: 返金以外は直近返金額保存。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action ≠ 2 → out.refunded = s.refunded\n\nAssumption: 状態の各フィールドとaction・amountはu64値であり、初期状態についてそれ以外の制限は置かない。\n\nAssumption: 検証対象はkernel.rsの純粋なstepのみ。CLIの解析・表示・初期化・I/O、永続化、並行処理、物理的な現金の出力、コンパイラや実行環境は対象外。\n\nAssumption: 商品価格は150円固定。amountは投入時のみ使用し、返金額は累積値ではなく直近の返金額である。\n\nExample 0: before=[0, 10, 0]; arguments=[0, 200]; after=[200, 10, 0]\n\nExample 1: before=[200, 10, 0]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[50, 9, 0]\n\nExample 2: before=[149, 1, 7]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[149, 1, 7]\n\nExample 3: before=[150, 0, 7]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[150, 0, 7]\n\nExample 4: before=[150, 1, 7]; arguments=[1, 18446744073709551615]; after=[0, 0, 7]\n\nExample 5: before=[50, 9, 7]; arguments=[2, 0]; after=[0, 9, 50]\n\nExample 6: before=[0, 9, 50]; arguments=[2, 0]; after=[0, 9, 0]\n\nExample 7: before=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]; arguments=[0, 1]; after=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]\n\nExample 8: before=[0, 1, 7]; arguments=[0, 18446744073709551615]; after=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]\n\nExample 9: before=[42, 3, 7]; arguments=[18446744073709551615, 99]; after=[42, 3, 7]\n\nProof scope: this pure transition and the listed formal properties. Not caller authentication, other state mutations, persistence, concurrency, parsers or certification. Descriptions and environmental assumptions require review; they are not proved by the checker.",
