  "review": "vending_machine_step\n\n自販機の純粋なstepの全u64入力に対する契約。価格150円。action=0は投入し加算オーバーフローなら全状態保存、1は残高150以上かつ在庫正の場合のみ購入、2は全額返金、それ以外は全状態保存。直近返金額は返金時のみ更新。条件式をフィールドごとに記述するが振る舞いと検証範囲は変更しない。\n\nSource: kernel.rs\n\nRust API:\npub struct Machine { pub balance: u64, pub stock: u64, pub refunded: u64 }\npub fn step(s: Machine, action: u64, amount: u64) -> Machine\n\nSpecification (s is the input state):\n{ balance := if action = 0 ∧ s.balance + amount ≤ 18446744073709551615 then s.balance + amount else if action = 1 ∧ 150 ≤ s.balance ∧ 0 < s.stock then s.balance - 150 else if action = 2 then 0 else s.balance, stock := if action = 1 ∧ 150 ≤ s.balance ∧ 0 < s.stock then s.stock - 1 else s.stock, refunded := if action = 2 then s.balance else s.refunded }\n\nAll state fields and parameters are unsigned 64-bit integers.\n\ninsert_exact: 加算可能な投入では残高を正確に増やし、在庫と直近返金額を保存する。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action = 0 ∧ s.balance + amount ≤ 18446744073709551615 → out.balance = s.balance + amount ∧ out.stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\noverflow_preserves: 投入の加算オーバーフロー時は全状態を保存する。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action = 0 ∧ 18446744073709551615 < s.balance + amount → out.balance = s.balance ∧ out.stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\npurchase_exact: 残高と在庫が十分なら価格150と在庫1を正確に減らし、直近返金額は保存する。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action = 1 ∧ 150 ≤ s.balance ∧ 0 < s.stock → out.balance = s.balance - 150 ∧ out.stock = s.stock - 1 ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\npurchase_rejected: 残高不足または在庫切れなら全状態保存。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action = 1 ∧ (s.balance < 150 ∨ s.stock = 0) → out.balance = s.balance ∧ out.stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\nrefund_exact: 全残高を直近返金額に記録し残高0、在庫保存。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action = 2 → out.balance = 0 ∧ out.stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.balance\n\ninvalid_preserves: 未定義操作は全状態保存。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action ≠ 0 ∧ action ≠ 1 ∧ action ≠ 2 → out.balance = s.balance ∧ out.stock = s.stock ∧ out.refunded = s.refunded\n\nstock_change_only_buy: 在庫変更は購入成功時のみ。\nlet out := transition s action amount; out.stock ≠ s.stock → action = 1 ∧ 150 ≤ s.balance ∧ 0 < s.stock\n\nrefund_preserved: 返金以外は直近返金額保存。\nlet out := transition s action amount; action ≠ 2 → out.refunded = s.refunded\n\nAssumption: 状態の各フィールドとaction・amountはu64値であり、初期状態についてそれ以外の制限は置かない。\n\nAssumption: 検証対象はkernel.rsの純粋なstepのみ。CLIの解析・表示・初期化・I/O、永続化、並行処理、物理的な現金の出力、コンパイラや実行環境は対象外。\n\nAssumption: 商品価格は150円固定。amountは投入時のみ使用し、返金額は累積値ではなく直近の返金額である。\n\nExample 0: before=[0, 10, 0]; arguments=[0, 200]; after=[200, 10, 0]\n\nExample 1: before=[200, 10, 0]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[50, 9, 0]\n\nExample 2: before=[149, 1, 7]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[149, 1, 7]\n\nExample 3: before=[150, 0, 7]; arguments=[1, 0]; after=[150, 0, 7]\n\nExample 4: before=[150, 1, 7]; arguments=[1, 18446744073709551615]; after=[0, 0, 7]\n\nExample 5: before=[50, 9, 7]; arguments=[2, 0]; after=[0, 9, 50]\n\nExample 6: before=[0, 9, 50]; arguments=[2, 0]; after=[0, 9, 0]\n\nExample 7: before=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]; arguments=[0, 1]; after=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]\n\nExample 8: before=[0, 1, 7]; arguments=[0, 18446744073709551615]; after=[18446744073709551615, 1, 7]\n\nExample 9: before=[42, 3, 7]; arguments=[18446744073709551615, 99]; after=[42, 3, 7]\n\nProof scope: this pure transition and the listed formal properties. Not caller authentication, other state mutations, persistence, concurrency, parsers or certification. Descriptions and environmental assumptions require review; they are not proved by the checker.",
